  "_comment": "Your station (server/src/game/Outpost.ts): chartered at a level, for credits and plate, at one of the sites (beside an existing station). Each track has five tiers: a tier costs its cost (from storage) and builds for its minutes, wall-clock (it carries on while you're away). A tier's perks: refineTime/fabTime multiply job times, refineYield adds plate a batch, traceMul multiplies traces, fabSlots/hangarSlots add to the unlocks, cutFail takes off a gem cut's fail chance, rounds are ammunition only an armoury presses (the recipe still has to be learned: Quench Slugs, from Forgemaster Hale's job cinder_quench), rumours brings rumours from anywhere. Perks stack: a track gives everything up to its tier.",
